	<row id="msg_0691_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hearin’ about your adventures shake my\nsoul! It sure do!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0691_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m so glad you called!\rI was JUST ’bout to call you too!\nWe must be a perfect match!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0691_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How you doin’?\rWhat you doin’?\rWhere you at?\rHow many Chains you got now?\rHow much bread you got stacked?\rHow your mom?\rYou got lotsa homies?\rIs it gon’ be sunny tomorrow?\rArrgh, there’s SO much I wanna\nchat about! This goin’ nowhere!</language>
	</row>
